<br /><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"> Snow fell gently from the sky as Argent Adept silently cleaned his bar. To his surprise, Haka, Setback, Tempest, and Wrath charged in, tired expressions glaring longingly at alcohol they desperately wanted. 
