<br /><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"> The park was a place of relaxation for the immortal Maori warrior to simply relax and unwind from subbing for kindergartners and crazy super villains. The park also tended to be a place where his nemesis Ambuscade liked to Ambush him. Case in point, bullets flying from all places from the most likely invisible hunter. 
